  m_text: "<i>After station 1.</i>\nWith HDR on, the frame keeps values above 1. Tonemapping maps them into the range the screen can show. Volume - Post \u203A Tonemapping \u203A Mode: None, Neutral or ACES.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> The ring is about six times brighter than 1. From None to Neutral to ACES: what happens to its brightest parts, to its colour and to the dark water?\n\n<b>Try:</b> Switch the Mode and compare the three. Pick one for this picture.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: 01\u201304</color></size>"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
